<title>BANGLADESH: Diarrhoea kills 30 in Bangladesh storm aftermath.</title>
<headline>Diarrhoea kills 30 in Bangladesh storm aftermath.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A diarrhoea outbreak in Bangladesh has killed at least 30 people and affected thousands following a fierce cyclone last week, the press secretary to Prime Minister Sheikh Hasina said on Monday.</p>
</text>
